Swimming
They swim the same amount of time
Gallant swims 0 minutes in the lake, Goofus swims 1 minute in the lake
Gallant does check the water temperature first before swimming
Goofus does not check the water temperature first before swimming
The first loop checks for a condition to be true while the second loop is guaranteed to run at least one time because of true.
First loop is a pretest loop while second loop is a post test loop

